{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17942","headline":"重云李观疾赠之 · 韩愈","name":"重云李观疾赠之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天行失其度，阴气来干阳。\n重云闭白日，炎燠成寒凉。\n小人但咨怨，君子惟忧伤。\n饮食爲减少，身体岂宁康。\n此志诚足贵，惧非职所当。\n藜羹尚如此，肉食安可尝。\n穷冬百草死，幽桂乃芬芳。\n且况天地间，大运自有常。\n劝君善饮食，鸾凤本高翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}